      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so i got this huge painful red lump on my upper back. it feels really tight and like it's full of fluid or something. its getting kind of hard to sleep cuz of the throbbing. do u think it's okay if i just use a sterile needle to pop it and drain it myself so it heals faster? it looks like it needs to come out",
