      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk i dont really have time to go to the doctor right now, it's so expensive and i'm pretty sure i can just keep it clean. i have a medical grade sterile lancet and some rubbing alcohol. if i just do a tiny tiny nick to let the pressure out, isn't that way safer than just letting it keep throbbing and getting bigger? it's not like a deep wound or anything.",
